{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1789745566","published":"2026-09-18T15:32:57Z","modified":"2026-11-27T16:30:12.232867895Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-89157"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2026-89157","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: Integer overflow in the allocation size computation of\n     pcre2_pattern_convert() and pcre2_substring_get_bynumber() leading to an\n     undersized buffer and an out-of-bounds heap write, because both sites\n     multiplied the code-unit count by the code-unit BIT width rather than its\n     byte width and never checked the product for wraparound; reachable with a\n     large pattern or captured substring on 32-bit platforms\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-89157.patch: size both allocations with\n       CU2BYTES() and reject a code-unit count that would overflow\n       sizeof(pcre2_memctl) + CU2BYTES(n + 1), in src/pcre2_convert.c and\n       src/pcre2_substring.c\n     - CVE-2026-89157","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libpcre2-16-0","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libpcre2-16-0?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"10.36-2+deb11u1+tuxcare.els3"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1789745566.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libpcre2-32-0","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libpcre2-32-0?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"10.36-2+deb11u1+tuxcare.els3"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1789745566.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libpcre2-8-0","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libpcre2-8-0?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"10.36-2+deb11u1+tuxcare.els3"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian